  "limitations": [
    "All 28 owner methods executed on Windows CPython3.13 both from source and from the actual isolated installed 41-file wheel. Cross-platform and full original-suite geometry evidence belong to root integration, not inferred from spawn APIs.",
    "No arbitrary workerFactory, Node/JVM fallback, new input-domain/algorithm strategy or logging/timing tree is implemented.",
    "Input JSON copying is synchronous host validation; real layout CPU, spawn/IPC and reaping are offloaded. There is no hard RAM quota.",
    "Private synthetic CPU/worker fixtures isolate queue/crash/protocol races and are not native-layout CPU evidence; separate tests exercise genuine pipeline progress, heartbeat, overlap and cancellation.",
    "A schema-valid message from a deliberately replaced trusted worker is not cryptographic proof of geometry. Independent V comparison checks actual outputs and preservation.",
    "Fixed git blob hashes use canonical LF; local Windows working-tree hashes are recorded separately rather than conflated."
  ]
